      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DOONGALLA ROCKET (7) hit the frame three on end before being rewarded with a deserved win last time, scoring at Ballarat over 390m (21.91). Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. PAW PALMER (4) ran well two back when hitting the frame then out of the placings at Sandown latest but returns to a course where he has performed well. Well placed here and should do much better. MORE BEER PLEASE (6) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (22.53) last time in a Free For All at Shepparton. Form here sound including six wins. Likely to be thereabouts. LEKTRA DAMIAN (2) has claims again if he runs up to the latest effort.",
